{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/c7ce1eee9c083e783c42e7dfdf070c15.poster.avif?t=1770124933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/c7ce1eee9c083e783c42e7dfdf070c15.webm?t=1770124933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/c7ce1eee9c083e783c42e7dfdf070c15.mp4?t=1770124933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f <strong>Welcome to the Dump</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore endless piles of junk, dig up lost cards, and expand your collection. Everything that was once lost \u2014 can now be found again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf\u00a0Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, sort, collect.<br>Every pile of trash is a chance to find a rare card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the birds</strong><br>Pull them out of garbage piles and make them cozy nests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible cards</strong><br>Restore your full collection of favorite cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor, references, and trash aesthetics</strong><br>A world where garbage is art, and every discovery can become a trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No battles. Just trash.</strong><br>You just dig. In garbage. For love. And for cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/73f5c615ad0dc6bce407e3e72a5f2eae.poster.avif?t=1770124933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/73f5c615ad0dc6bce407e3e72a5f2eae.webm?t=1770124933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868310/extras/73f5c615ad0dc6bce407e3e72a5f2eae.mp4?t=1770124933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0Who\u2019s it for?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love simulators, collecting, irony, and relaxing gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe for those who still remember their lost card collection.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aspiring Entrepreneur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/cc31111dd1df95acf8ace8241aa0aa6c918462bb.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/74b2693a3ed28349be28144bc56adbe32101fae5.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Commerce","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/5470922530a7fbf4e5380b7c264e6fc57d7cfbbf.jpg"},{"name":"First Trash Bag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/2d4ec75838efa4cf72841cbc25ed8e5e65d61900.jpg"},{"name":"Waste Dealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/b113cfa4f44884669611abc442f76db518ebb0ae.jpg"},{"name":"Garbage Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/d545e7ca8eca143f2a0debfcea1526fc8bbb14b6.jpg"},{"name":"Card Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/b0f256a97e9a3d5abaee670fcd53d60fdefe5799.jpg"},{"name":"Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3868310/ceadd93deefe02dc551b745572c4f60a40bd1d79.jpg"},{"name":"Master Coll